# ── Rotato .gitignore ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# User-owned runtime data (yours to keep out of version control):
#   config/   service config + admin-UI saves (seeded automatically)
#   data/     local image files for `sources:`
# Local deployment overrides:
#   .env      compose variable overrides (PUID/PGID/TZ/TARGETARCH)

# User data
/config/
/data/
.env

# Local Go build
/rotato
/rotato.exe

# Docker transfer artifacts
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Editor / OS cruft
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
